# Built-in icon bakes -- consumed by `image_tool icons` (source/tools/image_tool/image_tool.c).
#
#   <name> <source.svg> [-size <px>] [-margin <px>] [-out <path>]
#
# <name> is the gui icon registry key (gui()->find_icon) and the default output stem.
# <source.svg> resolves against assets/icon_source/.  -size/-margin default to 256/16, generous
# headroom over icon_register_sdf's out_max default of 64 -- the built-in set loads as distance
# fields (icon_load_builtins in gui_icon_load.c), which needs the source rasterized several times
# larger than its display size with a transparent margin for the field to fall off into.
#
# Nothing bakes automatically: re-run `image_tool icons config/icons.manifest` from the repo root
# whenever source art under assets/icon_source/ changes, then rebuild -- the output PNGs under
# assets/icon/ are checked in like any other asset.

settings settings.svg
file     file.svg
save     save.svg
folder   folder.svg

